{"suttaId":"tha-ap62","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[4194,4244],"vripara":"78"},"segments":{"tha-ap62:0.3":"Asanabodhiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap62:1.1":"“Jātiyā sattavassohaṃ,","tha-ap62:1.2":"addasaṃ lokanāyakaṃ;","tha-ap62:1.3":"Pasannacitto sumano,","tha-ap62:1.4":"upagacchiṃ naruttamaṃ.","tha-ap62:2.1":"“Tissassāhaṃ bhagavato,","tha-ap62:2.2":"lokajeṭṭhassa tādino;","tha-ap62:2.3":"Haṭṭho haṭṭhena cittena,","tha-ap62:2.4":"ropayiṃ bodhimuttamaṃ.","tha-ap62:3.1":"“Asano nāmadheyyena,","tha-ap62:3.2":"dharaṇīruhapādapo;","tha-ap62:3.3":"Pañcavasse paricariṃ,","tha-ap62:3.4":"asanaṃ bodhimuttamaṃ.","tha-ap62:4.1":"“Pupphitaṃ pādapaṃ disvā,","tha-ap62:4.2":"abbhutaṃ lomahaṃsanaṃ;","tha-ap62:4.3":"Sakaṃ kammaṃ pakittento,","tha-ap62:4.4":"buddhaseṭṭhaṃ upāgamiṃ.","tha-ap62:5.1":"“Tisso tadā so sambuddho,","tha-ap62:5.2":"sayambhū aggapuggalo;","tha-ap62:5.3":"Bhikkhusaṅghe nisīditvā,","tha-ap62:5.4":"imā gāthā abhāsatha.","tha-ap62:6.1":"“‘Yenāyaṃ ropitā bodhi,","tha-ap62:6.2":"buddhapūjā ca sakkatā;","tha-ap62:6.3":"Tamahaṃ kittayissāmi,","tha-ap62:6.4":"suṇātha mama bhāsato.","tha-ap62:7.1":"“‘Tiṃsakappāni devesu,","tha-ap62:7.2":"devarajjaṃ karissati;","tha-ap62:7.3":"Catusaṭṭhi cakkhattuṃ so,","tha-ap62:7.4":"cakkavattī bhavissati.","tha-ap62:8.1":"“‘Tusitā hi cavitvāna,","tha-ap62:8.2":"sukkamūlena codito;","tha-ap62:8.3":"Dve sampattī anubhotvā,","tha-ap62:8.4":"manussatte ramissati.","tha-ap62:9.1":"“‘Padhānapahitatto so,","tha-ap62:9.2":"upasanto nirūpadhi;","tha-ap62:9.3":"Sabbāsave pariññāya,","tha-ap62:9.4":"nibbāyissatināsavo’.","tha-ap62:10.1":"“Vivekamanuyuttohaṃ,","tha-ap62:10.2":"upasanto nirūpadhi;","tha-ap62:10.3":"Nāgova bandhanaṃ chetvā,","tha-ap62:10.4":"viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap62:11.1":"“Dvenavute ito kappe,","tha-ap62:11.2":"bodhiṃ ropesahaṃ tadā;","tha-ap62:11.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi,","tha-ap62:11.4":"bodhiropassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap62:12.1":"“Catusattatito kappe,","tha-ap62:12.2":"daṇḍasenoti vissuto;","tha-ap62:12.3":"Sattaratanasampanno,","tha-ap62:12.4":"cakkavattī tadā ahuṃ.","tha-ap62:13.1":"“Tesattatimhito kappe,","tha-ap62:13.2":"sattāhesuṃ mahīpatī;","tha-ap62:13.3":"Samantanemināmena,","tha-ap62:13.4":"rājāno cakkavattino.","tha-ap62:14.1":"“Paṇṇavīsatito kappe,","tha-ap62:14.2":"puṇṇako nāma khattiyo;","tha-ap62:14.3":"Sattaratanasampanno,","tha-ap62:14.4":"cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap62:15.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe …","tha-ap62:15.3":"kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap62:16.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā asanabodhiyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap62:17.1":"Asanabodhiyattherassāpadānaṃ dasamaṃ.","tha-ap62:18.1":"Bījanivaggo chaṭṭho.","tha-ap62:19.1":"Tassuddānaṃ –","tha-ap62:20.1":"Bījanī sataraṃsī ca,","tha-ap62:20.2":"sayanodakivāhiyo;","tha-ap62:20.3":"Parivāro padīpañca,","tha-ap62:20.4":"dhajo padumapūjako;","tha-ap62:20.5":"Bodhi ca dasamo vutto,","tha-ap62:20.6":"gāthā dvenavuti tathā."},"unsure":[],"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2599,"to":2602,"paras":[{"para":2599,"vripara":"78","refs":["tha-ap62:1"],"lines":["So pubbasambhāramanussaritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>jātiyā sattavassohan</b>tiādimāha.","Tattha <b>jātiyā</b>ti mātugabbhato nikkhantakālato paṭṭhāyāti attho.","Sattavasso paripuṇṇasarado ahaṃ lokanāyakaṃ tissaṃ bhagavantaṃ addasanti sambandho.","<b>Pasannacitto sumano</b>ti pakārena pasannaanāluḷitaavikampitacitto, sumano sundaramano somanassasahagatacittoti attho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap62:1"],["tha-ap62:1"],["tha-ap62:1"],["tha-ap62:1"]]},{"para":2600,"vripara":"79","refs":["tha-ap62:2"],"lines":["<b>Tissassāhaṃ bhagavato</b>ti tikkhattuṃ jātoti tisso, so mātugabbhato, manussajātito, pañcakkhandhato ca mutto hutvā jāto nibbatto buddho jātoti attho.","Tassa tissassa bhagavato tādino, lokajeṭṭhassa asanabodhiṃ uttamaṃ ropayinti sambandho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap62:2"],["tha-ap62:2"]]},{"para":2601,"vripara":"80","refs":["tha-ap62:3"],"lines":["<b>Asano nāmadheyyenā</b>ti nāmapaññattiyā nāmasaññāya asano nāma asanarukkho bodhi ahosīti attho.","<b>Dharaṇīruhapādapo</b>ti vallirukkhapabbatagaṅgāsāgarādayo dhāretīti dharaṇī, kā sā?","Pathavī, tassaṃ ruhati patiṭṭhahatīti dharaṇīruho, pādena pivatīti pādapo, pādasaṅkhātena mūlena siñcitodakaṃ pivati āporasaṃ sinehaṃ dhāretīti attho.","Dharaṇīruho ca so pādapo cāti dharaṇīruhapādapo, taṃ uttamaṃ asanaṃ bodhiṃ pañca vassāni <b>paricariṃ</b> posesinti attho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap62:3"],["tha-ap62:3"],["tha-ap62:3"],["tha-ap62:3"]]},{"para":2602,"vripara":"81","refs":["tha-ap62:4"],"lines":["<b>Pupphitaṃ pādapaṃ disvā</b>ti taṃ mayā positaṃ asanabodhirukkhaṃ pupphitaṃ accharayoggabhūtapupphattā <b>abbhutaṃ</b> lomahaṃsakaraṇaṃ disvā <b>sakaṃ kammaṃ</b> attano kammaṃ <b>pakittento</b> pakārena kathayanto buddhaseṭṭhassa santikaṃ agamāsinti attho.","Sesaṃ sabbattha uttānatthamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap62:4"],["tha-ap62:4"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap62:1.1","jātiyā sattavassohaṃ",0,0],["tha-ap62:1.1","jātiyā",0,1],["tha-ap62:1.3","pasannacitto sumano",0,3],["tha-ap62:2.1","tissassāhaṃ bhagavato",1,0],["tha-ap62:3.1","asano nāmadheyyenā",2,0],["tha-ap62:3.1","dharaṇīruhapādapo",2,1],["tha-ap62:3.3","paricariṃ",2,3],["tha-ap62:4.1","abbhutaṃ",3,0],["tha-ap62:4.1","pupphitaṃ pādapaṃ disvā",3,0],["tha-ap62:4.3","pakittento",3,0],["tha-ap62:4.3","sakaṃ kammaṃ",3,0]],"before":[{"para":2596,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Padumattheraapadānavaṇṇanā samattā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":2597,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Asanabodhiyattheraapadānavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":2598,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["<b>Jātiyā sattavassohan</b>tiādikaṃ āyasmato asanabodhiyattherassa apadānaṃ.","Ayampi purimabuddhesu katādhikāro tattha tattha bhave vivaṭṭūpanissayāni puññāni upacinanto tissassa bhagavato kāle aññatarasmiṃ kulagehe nibbatto vuddhippatto sukhappatto sāsane pasanno asanabodhito phalaṃ gahetvā tato vuṭṭhitabodhitaruṇe gahetvā bodhiṃ ropesi, yathā na vinassati tathā udakāsiñcanādikammena rakkhitvā pūjesi.","So tena puññena devamanussesu sampattiyo anubhavitvā imasmiṃ buddhuppāde kulagehe nibbatto paripakkasambhārattā sattavassikova samāno pabbajitvā khuraggeyeva arahattaṃ pāpuṇi, purākatapuññanāmena <b>asanabodhiyatthero</b>ti pākaṭo."],"lineRefs":[[],[],[]]}]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
